<title>USA: Jacksonville, Fla., $65 mln bond deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Jacksonville, Fla., $65 mln bond deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Monday it repriced Jacksonville, Fla.'s $65.5 million bond deal. The top yield was 5.55 percent in 2018.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CITY OF JACKSONVILLE FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $65,485,000*</p>
<p>SALES TAX REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>(RIVER CITY RENAISSANCE PROJECT)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>REPRICING IS AS FOLLOWS:</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
